window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-1e04f0e469568257"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"settings\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">设置</h1> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code> 可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>你可以通过设置面板个性化应用，并管理日常偏好。打开应用菜单中的<strong>设置</strong>（已阻止不安全链接），或按</p> <p><kbd>Cmd</kbd>+<kbd>,</kbd>（macOS）或 <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>,</kbd>（Windows）。</p> <p><a id=\"general\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">常规</h2> <p>你可以选择是否按 <strong>Enter</strong> 发送提示，或要求多行提示、乃至所有提示都必须通过组合键发送：macOS 上按 <kbd>Cmd</kbd>+<kbd>Enter</kbd>，Windows 和 Linux 上按 <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Enter</kbd>。在 macOS 和 Linux 上，还可以启用<strong>运行时防止休眠（Prevent sleep while running）</strong>，这样你离开电脑后，本地聊天仍可继续。在<strong>后续消息行为（Follow-up behavior）</strong>中，选择 ChatGPT 正在工作时发送的消息是引导当前运行，还是留待下一次运行处理。</p> <p><a id=\"profile\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">个人资料</h2> <p>在<strong>个人资料</strong>中查看活动概览、累计词元（token）数、峰值词元（token）数、连续使用天数、最长任务和词元（token）使用情况。你也可以更新头像、显示名称和用户名等资料，并保存一张展示使用情况的个人资料卡片。消费者版 ChatGPT 方案可分享个人资料卡片。</p> <p>符合条件的用户还可以从个人资料菜单发送 Codex 邀请。在符合条件的个人方案中选择<strong>邀请朋友</strong>，或在符合条件的 Business 工作区中选择<strong>邀请同事</strong>。有关当前奖励、限制和资格要求，请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7?anchor=invite-friends-and-coworkers\">邀请朋友和同事</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"keyboard-shortcuts\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">键盘快捷键</h2> <p>打开<strong>键盘快捷键</strong>以查看命令、更改按键绑定，或将自定义快捷键重置为默认值。你可以按命令名称搜索，也可以切换到按按键搜索，然后按下某个组合键，查找使用该组合键的命令。</p> <p><a id=\"notifications\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">通知</h2> <p>选择在什么情况下显示轮次完成通知，以及应用是否应请求通知权限。</p> <p><a id=\"appearance\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">外观</h2> <p>在<strong>设置</strong>中，你可以选择基础主题、调整强调色/背景色/前景色，以及更改界面和代码字体。你也可以与朋友分享自定义主题。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：ChatGPT 桌面应用的外观设置，展示主题选择、颜色控件和字体选项</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"pets\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">宠物</h2> <p>宠物是应用中可选的动画伙伴。在<strong>设置 &gt; 宠物</strong>中选择内置或自定义宠物，然后使用 <code>/pet</code>、<strong>显示宠物</strong>或<strong>隐藏宠物</strong>控制浮动叠层。选择<strong>迷你</strong>，即可在不显示宠物的情况下保留聊天控件。</p> <p>请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-74fe1167725e9c4d\">宠物</a>，了解如何开始聊天、使用语音、关注活动或创建自己的宠物。</p> <p class=\"notice\">原网页此处包含交互演示，请通过“查看官方来源”联网查看。</p> <p><a id=\"browser-use\"></a></p> <p><a id=\"browser\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_8\">浏览器</h2> <p>使用这些设置安装或启用捆绑的 Browser 插件、设置<a href=\"#/article/a-a7459570776840aa\">浏览器扩展</a>，以及管理浏览器权限。在<strong>智能体权限（Agent permissions）</strong>中，选择默认权限，并为特定网站添加例外。控制项包括<strong>浏览（Browse）</strong>、<strong>下载（Download）</strong>和<strong>上传（Upload）</strong>，可选设置包括<strong>需要批准（Requires approval）</strong>、<strong>始终允许（Always allow）</strong>和<strong>阻止（Block）</strong>。移除某网站的自定义权限后，该网站会恢复默认权限。你的组织可以限制这些控制项。</p> <p>有关浏览器预览、评论和 Computer Use 工作流，请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">内置浏览器</a>。</p> <h2 id=\"computer-use\">Computer Use</h2> <p>设置完成后，请检查 Computer Use 设置，以查看桌面应用访问权限及相关偏好。在 macOS 上，可前往 macOS“隐私与安全性”设置，撤销“屏幕录制”或“辅助功能”权限。</p> <p><a id=\"personalization\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_9\">个性化</h2> <p>为所选机器编辑你的 <a href=\"#/article/a-94f17e3de1ca7cb3\"><code>AGENTS.md</code> 个人指令</a>。代码仓库指令也可能适用于你的聊天。</p> <p><a id=\"suggested-prompts\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_10\">推荐提示</h2> <p>启用基于上下文的建议，在你打开或返回 ChatGPT 时显示可以继续处理的后续任务和事项。</p> <p><a id=\"memories\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_11\">记忆</h2> <p>在<strong>个性化（Personalization）</strong>中启用<strong>启用 Codex 记忆（Enable Codex memories）</strong>（该功能可用时），即可把先前聊天中的有用上下文带入后续工作。有关设置、存储位置以及单个聊天的控制方式，请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-7ea5a1f5cc6a25bc\">记忆</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"archived-tasks\"></a></p> <p><a id=\"archived-chats\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_12\">已归档的聊天</h2> <p><strong>已归档的聊天</strong>区域会列出已归档的聊天及其日期和项目上下文。选择<strong>取消归档</strong>即可恢复聊天。</p> <p><a id=\"keep-an-app-task-near-your-work\"></a> <a id=\"keep-an-app-chat-near-your-work\"></a> <a id=\"keep-a-task-near-your-work\"></a></p> <p><a id=\"keep-a-chat-near-your-work\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_13\">将聊天保持在工作内容旁边</h2> <p>在 ChatGPT 桌面应用中，可以将正在进行的聊天弹出到单独窗口，并放在浏览器、编辑器或设计预览旁边。如果你希望在其他应用中工作时聊天窗口仍保持可见，请启用<strong>始终置顶</strong>。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：ChatGPT 桌面应用中的聊天以浮动弹出窗口形式显示</p> </blockquote>","en":"<h1 id=\"settings\">Settings</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Use the settings panel to personalize the app and manage everyday preferences. Open <strong>Settings</strong> (blocked unsafe link) from the app menu or press</p> <p><kbd>Cmd</kbd>+<kbd>,</kbd> on macOS or <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>,</kbd> on Windows.</p> <h2 id=\"general\">General</h2> <p>Choose whether <strong>Enter</strong> sends prompts, or require <kbd>Cmd</kbd>+<kbd>Enter</kbd> on macOS or <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Enter</kbd> on Windows and Linux for multiline prompts or every prompt. On macOS and Linux, turn on <strong>Prevent sleep while running</strong> so local chats can continue while you step away. Under <strong>Follow-up behavior</strong>, choose whether a message sent while ChatGPT works should steer the current run or wait for the next run.</p> <h2 id=\"profile\">Profile</h2> <p>Use <strong>Profile</strong> to review activity insights, lifetime tokens, peak tokens, streaks, your longest task, and token activity. You can also update your profile details, such as your picture, display name, and username, and save a profile card with usage highlights. Sharing profile cards is available on consumer ChatGPT plans.</p> <p>Eligible users can also send Codex invitations from the profile menu. Choose <strong>Invite a friend</strong> on an eligible personal plan or <strong>Invite a coworker</strong> in an eligible Business workspace. See <a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7?anchor=invite-friends-and-coworkers\">Invite friends and coworkers</a> for current rewards, limits, and eligibility.</p> <h2 id=\"keyboard-shortcuts\">Keyboard shortcuts</h2> <p>Open <strong>Keyboard Shortcuts</strong> to review commands, change bindings, or reset custom shortcuts to their defaults. Use the search field to find shortcuts by command name, or switch to keystroke search and press a key combination to find the command that uses it.</p> <h2 id=\"notifications\">Notifications</h2> <p>Choose when turn completion notifications appear, and whether the app should prompt for notification permissions.</p> <h2 id=\"appearance\">Appearance</h2> <p>In <strong>Settings</strong>, you can change the app appearance by choosing a base theme, adjusting accent, background, and foreground colors, and changing the UI and code fonts. You can also share your custom theme with friends.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: ChatGPT desktop app Appearance settings showing theme selection, color controls, and font options</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"pets\">Pets</h2> <pre><code>Pets are optional animated companions for the app. In **Settings &gt; Pets**,\nchoose a built-in or custom pet, then use `/pet`, **Show pet**, or **Hide pet**\nto control the floating overlay. Choose **Mini** to keep the chat controls\nvisible without a pet.\n\nSee [Pets](../../../../zh-CN/learn.chatgpt.com/docs/pets__u_74fe1167725e9c4d.md?surface=app) to start chats, use voice, follow\nactivity, or create your own pet.\n</code></pre> <p class=\"notice\">This part of the official page contains an interactive demo. Open the official source online to view it.</p> <p><a id=\"browser-use\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"browser\">Browser</h2> <p>Use these settings to install or enable the bundled Browser plugin, set up the <a href=\"#/article/a-a7459570776840aa\">browser extension</a>, and manage browser permissions. Under <strong>Agent permissions</strong>, choose default permissions and add exceptions for specific websites. Controls include <strong>Browse</strong>, <strong>Download</strong>, and <strong>Upload</strong>, with options such as <strong>Requires approval</strong>, <strong>Always allow</strong>, and <strong>Block</strong>. Removing a site's custom permissions resets them to the defaults. Your organization can restrict these controls.</p> <p>See <a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">Built-in browser</a> for browser preview, comment, and Computer Use workflows.</p> <h2 id=\"computer-use\">Computer Use</h2> <p>Check your Computer Use settings to review desktop-app access and related preferences after setup. On macOS, revoke system-level access by updating Screen Recording or Accessibility permissions in macOS Privacy &amp; Security settings.</p> <h2 id=\"personalization\">Personalization</h2> <p>Edit your <a href=\"#/article/a-94f17e3de1ca7cb3\">personal instructions in <code>AGENTS.md</code></a> for the selected machine. Repository instructions can also apply to your chats.</p> <h2 id=\"suggested-prompts\">Suggested prompts</h2> <p>Use context-aware suggestions to surface follow-ups and tasks you may want to resume when you start or return to ChatGPT.</p> <h2 id=\"memories\">Memories</h2> <p>In <strong>Personalization</strong>, turn on <strong>Enable Codex memories</strong>, where available, to carry useful context from past chats into future work. See <a href=\"#/article/a-7ea5a1f5cc6a25bc\">Memories</a> for setup, storage, and controls for individual chats.</p> <p><a id=\"archived-tasks\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"archived-chats\">Archived chats</h2> <p>The <strong>Archived chats</strong> section lists archived chats with dates and project context. Use <strong>Unarchive</strong> to restore a chat.</p> <p><a id=\"keep-an-app-task-near-your-work\"></a> <a id=\"keep-an-app-chat-near-your-work\"></a> <a id=\"keep-a-task-near-your-work\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"keep-a-chat-near-your-work\">Keep a chat near your work</h2> <p>In the ChatGPT desktop app, pop out an active chat into a separate window and place it next to your browser, editor, or design preview. Turn on <strong>Always on top</strong> when you want the chat to remain visible while you work in another app.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: ChatGPT desktop app chat displayed in a floating pop-out window</p> </blockquote>"};
